    "name": "Hustle Public Access Token API",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "The Hustle Public API exposes a RESTful interface to provide programmatic access to resources within your Hustle account. The API is defined using the OpenAPI specification (aka Swagger) which can be downloaded above and used to generate a client in various languages. This may help speed up integration with the API, but is not required.",
